            <br>
            <h1>NF-κB Target Genes</h1>
         
            <div>
                
                <p>					
					This database lists consensus NF-κB target genes from two curated  lists at <a href="https://www.bu.edu/nf-kb/gene-resources/target-genes/" target="_blank">https://www.bu.edu/nf-kb/gene-resources/target-genes/</a> and <a href="http://bioinfo.lifl.fr/NF-KB/" target="_blank">http://bioinfo.lifl.fr/NF-KB/</a>. 

                </p>
				<p>
					Database was created by Angela and Mark Knepper in the <a href="http://esbl.nhlbi.nih.gov/" target="_blank">Epithelial Systems Biology Laboratory</a> (Mark Knepper, Chief) at the <strong>National Heart, Lung and Blood Institute</strong> as part of its Kidney Systems Biology Project. 
             
